CT,8,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1789410880
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G3/9
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, A man has been shot dead in Belfast,
OL,6, the second fatal shooting in the city
OL,7, in less than 12 hours.
OL,9,FIn the latest incident, gunmen opened
OL,10,Ffire on a police and army patrol. In a
OL,11,Ffollow-up operation by the security
OL,12,Fforces, a man was shot dead.
OL,13,         F
OL,14,FLocal people who said they saw the
OL,15,Fincident have disputed the version of
OL,16,Fevents given by the security forces -
OL,17,Fthat the man was shot by a soldier
OL,18,Fafter being challenged twice.
OL,19,F
OL,20,FThe IRA says it shot prominent loyalist
OL,21,FMr John Bingham in north Belfast early
OL,22,Ftoday. Two men are helping police with
OL,23,Ftheir enquiries.     D]CFrom 14-09-86
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,182,180,120,250,0,100
PN,18104
SC,0004
CT,8,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1789410880
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G4/9
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Three policemen have been seriously
OL,6, injured by a bomb explosion in central
OL,7, Paris, near the Champs Elysees.
OL,9,FThe device was found in a restaurant
OL,10,Fand carried to an underground car park,
OL,11,Fwhere it blew up.
OL,12,F
OL,13,FThe blast cut power cables, leading to
OL,14,Fa rush of calls to firemen to rescue
OL,15,Fpeople stuck in lifts.
OL,17,FThere has been a wave of bombings in
OL,18,Fthe French capital in the past week, in
OL,19,Fwhich one woman died and about 60
OL,20,Fpeople were injured.
OL,21,B
OL,23,T]CFrom 14-09-86   teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
