CT,8,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1789410880
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G5/9
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, All foreigners visiting France except
OL,6, EEC and Swiss citizens will need to
OL,7, have visas under one of a number of
OL,8, new anti-terrorist measures.
OL,10,FThe move was announced by Prime
OL,11,FMinister Chirac after the latest in a
OL,12,Fseries of bomb attacks in Paris.
OL,14,FThe visa requirement is expected to
OL,15,Flast for six months.
OL,17,FIn addition, 1,000 French soldiers are
OL,18,Fbeing assigned to strengthen frontier
OL,19,Fsecurity.
OL,23,T]CFrom 14-09-86   teletextarchive.com
