CT,8,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1789410880
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G7/9
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, The Social Democrats have approved a
OL,6, policy calling for the cancellation of
OL,7, the planned Trident nuclear missile
OL,8, system.
OL,10,FThe motion passed at the SDP conference
OL,11,Fin Harrogate also called for a stronger
OL,12,FEuropean role in NATO.
OL,14,FThe SDP's approval for a stronger
OL,15,Fcontribution to NATO falls short of
OL,16,Fcalling for a replacement for Polaris.
OL,18,FBut it urges an investigation into the
OL,19,Fpracticalities of building a minimum
OL,20,Fnuclear deterrent in co-operation with
OL,21,Fthe French.
OL,23,T]CFrom 14-09-86   teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,182,180,120,250,0,100
