PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1789410880
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0 SDP GG8/9
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4 CONFERENCE
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##! ##########
OL,5, The Social Democrat Party has rejected
OL,6, any commitment to renationalise British
OL,7, Telecom and British Gas.
OL,9,FDelegates at the Harrogate conference
OL,10,Fvoted by 154 to 84 against a proposal
OL,11,Fleaving the way clear for possible
OL,12,Ffuture renationalisation.
OL,14,FThe motion was defeated after economic
OL,15,Fspokesman Mr Ian Wrigglesworth warned
OL,16,Fthat it would provide damaging
OL,17,Fammunition for the Conservatives.
OL,19,FMr Wrigglesworth said the Conservatives
OL,20,Fwould interpret the proposal as a total
OL,21,Fcommitment to renationalisation.
OL,23,T]CFrom 14-09-86   teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,182,180,120,250,0,100
