PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1789410880
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G9/9
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Five people have been killed in a bomb
OL,6, explosion at Seoul airport in South
OL,7, Korea.
OL,9,FNineteen others were injured in the
OL,10,Fblast. All the victims were members of
OL,11,Fthe airport staff.
OL,13,FPolice said the bomb was placed in a
OL,14,Frubbish bin at the airport and blamed
OL,15,FNorth Korea for the attack.
OL,16,F
OL,17,FSeoul is preparing to host more than
OL,18,F6,000 athletes and officials from 28
OL,19,Fcountries at the Asian Games, starting
OL,20,Fnext Saturday.
OL,21,F
OL,22,F
OL,23,T]CFrom 14-09-86   teletextarchive.com
